        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we discover or in-license product candidates and advance them into the clinic, we design development strategies to rapidly establish proof-of-concept and apply stringent criteria to decide which product candidates should move forward.",
