        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors also may obtain FDA or regulatory approval from comparable foreign regulatory authorities for their product candidates more rapidly than we may obtain approval for ours, which could result in our competitors establishing a strong market position before we are able to enter the market or make our development more complicated.",
