        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also currently exploring development of next-generation MRGPRX2 molecules that we believe can be optimized for select indications to bolster our intellectual property portfolio and potentially complement our product candidates to better manage the life cycle management of our development programs.",
